283088089274a568/1750486314/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1447364122","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/2034896/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Action"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Remote Play on TV","Steam Trading Cards","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"controller":"full","dev":["Cyanide Studio"],"pub":["Cyanide Studio","Nacon"],"released":"Oct 7, 2014","meta":71,"langs":["English","French","Italian","German","Spanish - Spain","Russian"],"min":[["OS","WINDOWS VISTA SP2/WINDOWS 7/WINDOWS 8"],["Processor","AMD/INTEL DUAL-CORE 2.4 GHZ"],["Memory","3072 MB RAM"],["Graphics","1024 MB 100% DIRECTX 9 AND SHADERS 4.0 COMPATIBLE AMD RADEON HD 5850/NVIDIA GEFORCE GTX 560 OR HIGHER"],["Storage","8 GB available space"],["Sound Card","DIRECTX 9 COMPATIBLE"],["Additional Notes","INTERNET CONNECTION REQUIRED FOR THE GAME ACTIVATION"]],"rec":[],"deck":3,"blurb":"Two centuries old and thoroughly sarcastic, the Goblin Styx stars in Styx: Master of Shadows, a stealth game with role-playing progression set in a dark fantasy world. He has made his way into the enormous Tower of Akenash, home of the World-Tree and its magical Amber sap, hoping to learn about his origins and profit along the way. Missions involve getting past guards unseen, recovering information and eliminating targets, either with quiet kills or by staging accidents.\n\nAmber-based abilities, such as invisibility or a decoy clone, complement skills unlocked through experience. The tower's vertical layout encourages searching for alternate routes. It is single-player with full controller support, suited to stealth fans who enjoy sneaking and planning."}}